	 <note id="GUID-809A1B6A-3E3F-4D77-A71C-97706680E0F6"> 
		<ol id="OL_D31E362CA4A94C0E95501C67BA4E7CA1"> 
		  <li id="LI_1BB1BFCEFF7D436A8FC9864516964D63">ΨSI is different from RSI, check 
			 <xref scope="local" format="dita" href="GUID-1D89D292-7CD3-4E06-9D28-4E18877EC4E0.dita"><?xm-replace_text Calculating Mobile Cooling Needs at Target PL1 (1)?></xref> for definition. 
		  </li> 
		  <li id="LI_A37534D034FC4C2CB4A76372732FEBB6">Technical Targets assume that the SOC is paired with discrete graphics for H 45W SKU. 
		  </li> 
		  <li id="LI_29B3AB2EF5224AC39F0CFF1B5E1B65DE">ΨSI is sensitive to the nature of the workload (ΨSI value shown is for IA centric workload). 
		  </li> 
		  <li id="LI_CDF4468662BE499BBA3DF35E3C041137"> The thermal solution used is referenced as note 7 and note 5 in 
			 <xref scope="local" format="dita" href="GUID-1D89D292-7CD3-4E06-9D28-4E18877EC4E0.dita"><?xm-replace_text Calculating Mobile Cooling Needs at Target PL1 (1)?></xref> and 
			 <xref scope="local" format="dita" href="GUID-A48C9490-D492-4F19-A004-6C387FF39CF8.dita">Cooling Needs and Density Factors (All Core Turbo)</xref> on page 23 respectively. 
		  </li> 
		  <li id="LI_B421307C49E245779CB5F7CBAD52EDFD"> 
			 <p> The thermal solution used is referenced as note 8 and note 6 in 
				<xref scope="local" format="dita" href="GUID-1D89D292-7CD3-4E06-9D28-4E18877EC4E0.dita"><?xm-replace_text Calculating Mobile Cooling Needs at Target PL1 (1)?></xref> and 
				<xref scope="local" format="dita" href="GUID-A48C9490-D492-4F19-A004-6C387FF39CF8.dita">Cooling Needs and Density Factors (All Core Turbo)</xref> on page 23 respectively. 
			 </p> 
		  </li> 
		</ol> 
